    <string name="howto_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="howto_body">1. Expert Option demo account, candlestick chart, platform indicators turned off.\n2. Zoom the chart out to show at least 55 candles (with fewer, EMA50/MACD stay off; with fewer than 25 there is no signal at all).\n3. After you start, a bubble appears. The set number of seconds before a candle closes, the bubble shows UP / DOWN / WAIT.\n4. If you want, take a demo trade on the signal. In the next minute\'s image the app compares the price at entry time with the price exactly 1 minute later and logs a win or loss (like a real 1-minute trade).\n5. The baseline counts whether price rose or fell every minute, with or without a signal, so you can compare setup results against it. If a result is wrong, tap it in the list below to change it.\n6. Tap the bubble = analyze now (not logged; a debug image is saved). Press and hold for 1 second to stop the app.\n7. At the first candle\'s signal, check that the clock is right: does the ⏱ on the bubble match the Expert Option timer? If not, change the clock offset.</string>

